item 4 measure is an assessment statement.

item 4 measure has for "cav:interpretation" the resource "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#InterpretationPositive".

item 4 measure has the judgement "-The data structure used in thisregulation should be comparable with the DCF set out in Regulation (EU) No2017/1004 of the European Parliament and of the Council.
-DG MARE collectsdata using the international FLUX standard (DG-MARE-FLUX-Brochure.pdf).".

item 4 measure has the statement type "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#StatementTypeStandardsMeasure".

