    actions_of_rules expects answers ["description 1 produces item 1 action", "description 2 produces item 2 action", "description 3 produces item 3 action", "description 4 produces item 4 action", "description 5 produces item 5 action", "description 6 produces action 11", "description 6 produces item 6 action", "description 7 produces item 7 action", "description 8 produces item 8 action"].
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 1", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 10", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 2", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 3", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 4", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 5", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 6", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 7", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 8", "commission eurostat acts as addressee in action 9", "commission eurostat acts as addresser in action 11", "international intergovernmental regional fisheries management organisations acts as addressee in item 6 action", "international organisations acts as addressee in action 11", "member states acts as addressee in item 5 action", "member states acts as addresser in action 1", "member states acts as addresser in action 10", "member states acts as addresser in action 2", "member states acts as addresser in action 3", "member states acts as addresser in action 4", "member states acts as addresser in action 5", "member states acts as addresser in action 6", "member states acts as addresser in action 7", "member states acts as addresser in action 8", "member states acts as addresser in action 9", "member states european commission acts as addressee in item 1 action", "member states european commission acts as addressee in item 2 action", "member states european commission acts as addressee in item 3 action", "member states european commission acts as addressee in item 4 action", "member states european commission acts as addressee in item 6 action", "member states european commission acts as addressee in item 7 action", "member states european commission acts as addressee in item 8 action"].

query deadlines is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as deadline.

query due_dates is:
    which agent has which action due on which date.

query due_in_2027 is:
    which agent has which action due on which date in the period from 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31.

query must_perform is:
    which party must perform which action by which date under which rule.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query places is:
    which rule is laid down in which place.

query addressers is:
    which agent acts as addresser in which action.

query addressees is:
    which agent acts as addressee in which action.

query beneficiaries is:
    which agent acts as beneficiary in which action.

query triggers is:
    which thing is triggered by which event.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query rules_of_act is:
    which rule is established by the act which act.

query provisions is:
    which thing is established in which provision.

query joint_rules is:
    which rule is established in more than one provision.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

