query publishers is:
    which thing is published by which agent.

query cited_resources is:
    which thing cites which resource.

query statement_types is:
    which assessment statement has the statement type which type.

query services_of_statements is:
    which thing concerns the service which service.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

